Content Warning: At certain points in this game, there are scenes that may be disturbing or upsetting to some players. Because this port is a faithful recreation of the original game, it includes the same dark humor and shock value from the 2020 executable.

A native Wii U port of the 2020 PC fangame Spongeman 9
Spongeman 9 (Wii U Port) is a native C++/SDL2 recreation of the 2020 Clickteam PC fangame, built from the ground up to run at a locked 60fps on Wii U hardware via Aroma.
Features:
• Native PowerPC .wuhb execution at 60fps
• Full Wii U GamePad and Pro Controller support
• Faithful recreation of the original scenes, animations, and audio

I created this because ive always found the game very diiferent to other shitpost/surreal games. It has a sense of mid 2000 flash games with its heavily compressed audio, horribly animated sprites and an overall bottleg sense which makes you start to think is this 
really a joke or a real, cheap ripoff? 

The original executable was developed by the developer KiHaa. As of 2026 i cannot track down the link to the creator. All thanks to KiHaa

The Games Factory 2 (TGF2) is a beginner-friendly, 2D game-creation software released by Clickteam in 2006. All thanks to click team

A heads-up: This ports creation was helped by the efforts of claude. If you dont condone vibe coded software this app is not for you...

